cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use feather, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Feather: a lightweight climate model evaluation framework"
abstract: >-
  Feather compares high-resolution climate models against observations
  (ERA5, CERES, EN4, ESA-CCI, HadISST, OSI-SAF, PIOMAS/GIOMAS, MSWEP,
  Berkeley Earth) and CMIP6/HighResMIP multi-model means. It generates
  diagnostic figures, LLM-analysed results, a LaTeX report and a static
  web dashboard.
